<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Carlovers half-yr net driven higher.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Carlovers half-yr net driven higher.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31. 	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  0.81 vs 0.72</p>
<p>    Net profit			  0.47 vs 0.43</p>
<p>    Sales				 7.77 vs 4.27</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   1.5 vs 1.75</p>
<p>NOTE: Carlovers Carwash Ltd is a carwashing service group.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
